## Optimizations Applied

### Query Reduction
| Optimization | Impact |
|-------------|--------|
| `About::cache()` via `once()` | 4 queries → 1 per request |
| `Profile::Timezone()` via `once()` | 3 queries → 1 per request |
| `Schema::hasTable('abouts')` via `once()` | 2 queries → 1 per request |
| `PENNANT_STORE=array` | ~9 DB queries → in-memory |
| `version-indicator` skip HTTP in on-prem | -1 HTTP call (5s timeout) |

### Infrastructure
| Optimization | Impact |
|-------------|--------|
| Composite index `sellings(tenant_id, is_paid, created_at)` | Seq scan → index scan |
| Composite index `sellings(tenant_id, date)` | Better date range queries |
| `wire:key` remove `time()` | Alpine re-init every render → stable DOM |
| `lazyLoadedDatabaseNotifications()` | Sync → async notification load |
| `NoCacheResponse` → `private, max-age=60` | bfcache works, back/forward instant |
| Polling intervals 30→120s | Fewer re-renders |

### On-Prem Specific
| Optimization | Impact |
|-------------|--------|
| `TrialBanner` early return on-prem | -1 query |
| `body-start` subscription skip on-prem | -3 queries |
| `version-indicator` skip HTTP on-prem | -1 HTTP block |

