## Testing Performance

### Enable Query Log (Dev Only)
```php
// In .env
ENABLE_QUERY_LOG=true

// Check in tinker
\DB::listen(function ($query) { dump($query->sql . ' [' . $query->time . 'ms]'); });
```

### Count Queries Per Page
```bash
php artisan tinker --execute="
\$queries = [];
\DB::listen(function (\$q) use (&\$queries) { \$queries[] = \$q->sql . ' [' . \$q->time . 'ms]'; });
// Navigate to the page in browser
dump(count(\$queries) . ' queries');
dump(\$queries);
"
```

### EXPLAIN a Query
```bash
php artisan tinker --execute="
echo \App\Models\Tenants\Selling::isPaid()
    ->whereBetween('created_at', [now()->subDays(7), now()])
    ->toRawSql();
"
# Then: DB::select('EXPLAIN <raw_sql>');
```

